<title>UK: London coal/ore fixtures.</title>
<headline>London coal/ore fixtures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>COAL - Kleovoulos of Rhodes - 100,000 tonnes coal Richards Bay/Taranto $6.60 fio scale load/30,000 shinc end Dec Deiulemar.</p>
<p>El Dorado - 130,000 tonnes coal Richards Bay/Rotterdam $6.25 fio scale load/25,000 shinc 1-10/1 Cobelfret.</p>
<p>TBN - 40,000 tonnes coal Xingang/Piombino $16 fio 4,000 shinc/7,000 shinc 1-15/12 Duferco.</p>
<p>ORE - Marshal Govorov - 90,000 tonnes ore Ponta da Ubu/Misurata $6.25-$6.50 fio scale load/40,000 shinc 20-30/12 Medmar.</p>
</text>
